# Valhalla Council (Cursor)

Eighteen founder council seats live as Cursor subagents in `.cursor/agents/*.md` (mirrored in `.claude/agents/` and `.codex/agents/`).

## Credo

We are all kings; Kings don't wait for the throne -- they build it.

## Truth rules (every seat)

- No invented MRR, closed deals, or revenue.
- Do not claim Spirit Airlines partnership/acquisition as closed or confirmed.
- L3/L4 Eyes Only stays out of prompts and investor drafts.
- Dated facts: `docs/valhalla-context.md`. Deep briefs: `council/agents/<id>.md`.

## How to invoke

Prefer the Task tool / subagent with matching `name`, or say one of:

- `Use the <seat> subagent to …`
- `Ask <Seat>: …`
- `@<seat> …` (e.g. `@athena`, `@lex`, `@icarus`)

| Seat | Invoke when |
| --- | --- |
| `athena` | Strategy order, war-game, stress-test, hidden move |
| `icarus` | Commander routing, Council vs Tribunal, cross-portfolio |
| `lex` | Legal exposure, claim substantiation, entity/contracts posture |
| `apollo` | Public voice, social, launch narrative |
| `helios` | Brand doctrine, credo, One Civilization story |
| `hermes` | Outreach, introductions, who hears what |
| `seshat` | Naming, measurement, canon |
| `natasha` | Founder OS, frameworks, weekly cadence |
| `daedalus` | Feasibility, architecture, invention path |
| `hephaestus` | Manufacturing, build, platforms |
| `demeter` | Land × energy, agrivoltaics, REAP/IRA |
| `poseidon` | Water domain, Viking/Atoll/Njord, MARAD |
| `sol` | Atoll product / solar presentation |
| `thor` | Wolf / land movement doctrine |
| `zeus` | Phenix / space / sky boundary |
| `teddy` | Abundance / Jefferson manifesto |
| `victory` | Performance systems, drills, metrics |
| `asclepius` | Founder stamina, recovery protocols |

## Routing

- Single-domain ask → one seat.
- Cross-portfolio or mode-setting → `icarus`, who may name follow-up seats.
- Investor-facing copy → involve `lex` (and usually `athena` or `helios`) before treating claims as final.
